                ]
              ],
              "sql": "SELECT product_id FROM products WHERE (price < 40 OR stock > 100) AND NOT stock = 0 ORDER BY product_name DESC;",
              "ordered": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "conclusion": "括号决定先算谁：Soap_1 价格低却是零库存，“NOT stock = 0”为假，整体就被去掉。"
